 * Proof steps:
001. DB = DA [00] & DA = DC [01] & DB = DF [04] ⇒  C,F,A,B are concyclic [07]
002. DB = DA [00] & DA = DC [01] & DB = DF [04] ⇒  D is the circumcenter of \Delta FCB [08]
