004. D is the circumcenter of \Delta FCB [08] & FG ⟂ DF [06] ⇒  ∠GFC = ∠FBC [10]
005. C,E,A are collinear [02] & ∠CFB = ∠CAB [09] & F,E,B are collinear [05] & ∠EBC = ∠ABE [03] & ∠GFC = ∠FBC [10] ⇒  ∠GFC = ∠ECF [11]
006. ∠GFC = ∠ECF [11] ⇒  FG ∥ CE [12]
